CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/k/g com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/path/FlowFieldGrid
	COMMENT FlowFieldGrid - the per-tile result of a flow-field (Dijkstra) path build, shared by every FlowFieldPath that targets the same tile. Fields: width/height (tile counts), targetX/targetY (the goal tile, written by PathSolver.g), direction (byte[]: the 8-way direction to walk from that tile, stored as direction+1 so 0 means "unvisited", -1 means closed) and closed (byte[] flag array; c(node) =&gt; is closed). [field names verified from PathSolver.g and this class]
	FIELD a width I
	FIELD b height I
	FIELD c targetX I
	FIELD d targetY I
	FIELD e direction [B
	FIELD f closed [B
